I mean when you laugh.

00:09:24.725 --> 00:09:26.390
- Like when you're jogging, laugh, yeah.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.963
- I meant when you laugh. (laughing)

00:09:28.963 --> 00:09:29.796
- Yes, when you pee.

00:09:29.796 --> 00:09:31.150
And then if you're singing a lot,

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.680
